Damn Vulnerable DeFi v4 levels in BounTEE

This directory uses three levels of Damn Vulnerable DeFi v4 (https://damnvulnerabledefi.xyz,
https://github.com/theredguild/damn-vulnerable-defi, tag v4.1.0, commit 64fddf9), by The Red
Guild and tinchoabbate, under the MIT licence. The licence's text is in LICENSE, beside this
file: "Copyright (c) 2021 Damn Vulnerable DeFi".

Copied unmodified from Damn Vulnerable DeFi v4.1.0:
  src/v4/DamnValuableToken.sol                       from src/DamnValuableToken.sol
  src/v4/truster/TrusterLenderPool.sol               from src/truster/
  src/v4/side-entrance/SideEntranceLenderPool.sol    from src/side-entrance/
  src/v4/puppet/PuppetPool.sol, IUniswapV1Exchange.sol, IUniswapV1Factory.sol
                                                     from src/puppet/

Modified by BounTEE (each file's header says how):
  src/adapted/PausableTrusterLenderPool.sol          from src/truster/TrusterLenderPool.sol
  src/adapted/PausableSideEntranceLenderPool.sol     from src/side-entrance/SideEntranceLenderPool.sol
  src/adapted/PausablePuppetPool.sol                 from src/puppet/PuppetPool.sol
The modification is the same in each: BounTEE's standard pause (src/adapted/PauseRole.sol,
OpenZeppelin Pausable with a pause-only role and no unpause) is added, and every function on
the level's exploit path refuses to run while paused. Each level's bug is kept unchanged.

BounTEE's own files here (MIT): src/adapted/PauseRole.sol, script/, test/, make-fixtures.ts.
The exploits in script/ are BounTEE's solutions to the three levels. Puppet's Uniswap pool
starts with 0.1 ETH and 0.1 DVT instead of DVD's 10 and 10 (see script/World.sol).

builds/uniswap/UniswapV1Exchange.json and UniswapV1Factory.json are the compiled Uniswap V1
contracts as Damn Vulnerable DeFi v4.1.0 ships them (builds/uniswap/), unmodified. Uniswap V1 is
licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0; its source is at
https://github.com/Uniswap/v1-contracts. They are deployed only on local test chains, as
Puppet's price source.

Libraries (fetched by soldeer, not committed): OpenZeppelin Contracts 5.2.0 (MIT), Solady
0.0.221 (MIT), Solmate (its ERC20.sol is
AGPL-3.0-only; used only because Damn Vulnerable DeFi's DamnValuableToken inherits it), forge-std 1.9.7 (MIT or Apache-2.0).
